# ChuckStation3 .gitignore — extends the upstream VS-centric ignore list
# with our build/, install/, ccache, and Android-specific artifacts.

## User-specific files
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs

